---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import SourcingRow from "../components/SourcingRow.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Sourcing & Design"
  description="Vinylast offers design, development, and resourcing with fabrication partners, patented components, and in-house manufacturing."
  currentPath="/sourcing-design"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sourcing & Design</p>
      <h1>The right product, specified for the job.</h1>
      <p>
        Tell us the application. We help you choose the railing, fencing, or accessory,
        and the details that make it install cleanly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>
        For over 30 years Vinylast Inc. has offered design, development and resourcing in partnership
        with our fabrication teams around the world. We currently hold many patents on different parts
        and systems including aluminum railing, post mounts and post brackets, infill baluster systems,
        window components, cable rail components and many other designs and components. All of our
        in-house manufacturing facilities have a well-trained work force and state of the art equipment
        to ensure the highest quality and performance from all of our imported and locally fabricated
        product lines.
      </p>
      <div class="sourcing-rows">
        <SourcingRow
          title="Services"
          image="/images/sourcing/services.jpg"
          imageAlt="Robotic arms welding metal, with sparks flying"
          items={[
            "Complete design, development and global product resourcing.",
            "OEM and private label programs packaged as needed.",
            "Direct shipping and stocking programs in the USA.",
            "3rd party testing and certification.",
          ]}
        />
        <SourcingRow
          title="Products"
          image="/images/sourcing/products.jpg"
          imageAlt="Hand reviewing mechanical drawings"
          imagePosition="right center"
          items={[
            "Aluminum and steel railing systems and components.",
            "Complete ADA railing systems.",
            "Stainless steel cable rail components.",
            "Glass, aluminum and horizontal baluster systems.",
            "Post mounts and post brackets.",
            "Window components.",
            "Casting components in aluminum, zinc and stainless steel.",
            "Injection molded parts in a variety of colors and plastics.",
            "Steel and aluminum stampings.",
          ]}
        />
        <SourcingRow
          title="What sets us apart"
          image="/images/sourcing/what-sets-us-apart.jpg"
          imageAlt="Hand resting on a stainless steel railing outdoors"
          items={[
            "Certified and integrated powder coat paint line.",
            "High speed casters and injection molders.",
            "Robotic welders and finishers.",
            "CNC milling and laser cutting in house.",
            "CCRR inspections and certification.",
            "QC implementations throughout manufacturing and shipping.",
            "Door to door delivery tracking.",
          ]}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand title="Build with us" text="Tell us what you are installing. We will point you to the right product and paperwork." />
</Layout>
